{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"짝수만 고르기","desc":"<p>정수 벡터에서 <b>짝수만</b> 골라 원래 순서대로 돌려주는 <code>even_numbers(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"even_numbers <- function(x) {\n  x[x %% 2 == 0]\n}\n","hint":"<p>논리 벡터로 원소를 고르는 방법: <code>x[조건]</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"even_numbers(c(1, 2, 3, 4))","expected":[2,4],"visible":true},{"call":"even_numbers(c(1, 3))","expected":[],"visible":true},{"call":"even_numbers(c(2, 4, 6))","expected":[2,4,6],"visible":false},{"call":"even_numbers(c(-2, -1, 0))","expected":[-2,0],"visible":false}],"starter":"even_numbers <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-321"}